# TRN02-BRIDGE-REPAIR -- fv7d. Boot Camp 2: deploying the MCV fires
# 'RedTeamRepairBridge' (Build Building Type GACNST) -> a RedTeam engineer
# reinforcement whose script line 46 attacks the CABHUT. In the original a
# computer-owned Infiltrate infantry (the loader 0x5243B9 sets Infiltrate for
# every Engineer=) attacking a building is sent in to capture it
# [RE: InfantryClass::Mission_Attack 0x51F0F0 -> Mission_Capture]; entering the
# BridgeRepairHut repairs the bridge (Mission_Enter 0x519449). The bridge's
# middle row (overlay 101 LOBRDG28, NoUseTileLandType=no) is the only ground
# route between the bases: the Shore sandbar's Beach sub-tiles (TMP byte 10)
# block Foot as in the original.
# fv8a: the MCV deploys at (42,28) like m-trn02-real -- the old (26,38) spot is
# the ore field and its ramps, refused by CanThisExistHere FUN_0047C530 since
# w8fix-place (faithful), so the ConYard never unfolded and the GACNST event
# (19) never fired the engineer reinforcement.
set render_every 0
set max_frames 3000
set campaign trn02t.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
waituntil 900 units(0,AMCV) >= 1
assert bridge_destroyed >= 1
wait 200
click unit 0:AMCV:0
click cell 42 28
waituntil 900 moving(0) == 0
wait 60
click unit 0:AMCV:0
key d
waituntil 600 buildings(0,GACNST) >= 1
until 1500 units(1,ENGINEER) >= 1
until 1500 bridge_destroyed == 0
assert bridge_destroyed == 0
assert units(1,ENGINEER) == 0
end
